ROOT-CAUSE ISOLATION
--------------------
b0 (window origin (0,0)) is bit-exact through every one of its 13 stages.
Blocks 1-4 introduce SHIFTED window origins (-4,-4), (0,-4), (-4,0) — the
zero-pad + crop path in partition.comp / gather_residual.comp. The b4ds
mismatch pattern (2-3% bitmatch vs 99.9%+ expected for exact semantics)
localizes the divergence to the shifted-origin window padding/gather path;
everything downstream (encoder/bottleneck/global/decoder/head) cascades from
it (chaotic graph; note b48/b69 bitmatch 0.0000 = e4m3 publishes of
completely decorrelated values, while fp32-internal accumulation would still
show partial correlation if only bias were wrong).

VERDICT
-------
Golden: COMPLETE and validated correct on block 0 (every rounding point,
every publish, raw-bias semantics). GPU chain: RUNS (48.4 ms steady,
1402 dispatches) but FAILS full-chain validation; root cause = shifted-window
origin handling (GPU kernels), second-order open question = bias unswizzle
not applied by the exe (nr_model deviation for 33 blocks if not intentional).
Blocker for PASS: GPU-side kernel fix + dump regen + rerun (both bias modes).


